### 7. ERREURS & CAS LIMITES
### ============================================

### 7.1 Ticket inexistant
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tickets/99999
Content-Type: application/json

### 7.2 Client inexistant
GET http://localhost:8000/api/clients/99999
Content-Type: application/json

### 7.3 Analyse avec description vide (doit échouer)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "",
  "client": {
    "id": 1,
    "nom": "Dupont",
    "prenom": "Marie",
    "email": "marie.dupont@email.com"
  }
}

### 7.4 Requête mal formée (doit échouer)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client": {}
}